  "body": "MACLEANS COLLEGE | BUCKLANDS BEACH INTERMEDIATE | BUCKLANDS BEACH PRIMARY\r\nSCHOOL ZONES\r\n\r\nYour opportunity to find the right home in Bucklands Beach.\r\n\r\nA new home is about more than fresh interiors. It is about finding a place that suits the way you live, in a neighbourhood where you want to be.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 45 Hattaway Avenue, a boutique collection of four brand-new homes, each offering its own position, layout and outdoor space.\r\n\r\nWith three bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms and internal-access garaging, these contemporary homes bring together everyday practicality and the appeal of an established East Auckland location.\r\n\r\nFour homes to explore:\r\nIndividual Titles and CCC issued\r\n45A: A distinctive corner position with private outdoor living.\r\n45B: A practical arrangement featuring a separate kitchen.\r\n45C: Contemporary, low-maintenance living with a private outdoor area.\r\n45D: Modern comfort with a welcoming indoor-outdoor connection.\r\n\r\nBucklands Beach offers an appealing combination of neighbourhood convenience, coastal surroundings and access to the wider Eastern Beaches area.\r\n\r\nFour homes. Different possibilities. Come and find your fit.",
